WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Insightful means showing deep understanding.. Negligible means too small to

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
matter.. Deteriorate means to get worse.. Flourish means to grow well; a synonym

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
is thrive.. Resilient means able to recover quickly.. Diverse means showing

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
variety; a synonym is varied.. Prominent means easily noticed or important..

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
Accumulate means to gather over time.. Deplete means to use up a resource..

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
Undermine means to weaken gradually..
